          "Engage the Native American constituency (estimated ~4% of population) authentically on water rights, resource development, and healthcare access: in Wyoming's governance landscape, these issues intersect with broader district interests and Native American constituent concerns deserve direct attention rather than invisibility, both as a matter of governance obligation and as practical constituent service."
